(Textbooks and past papers are published by government bodies.) Tj T*
(SriEdu does not re-host them. Each catalogue item stores:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  id          a stable identifier, e.g. ol-2023-science-ta) Tj T*
(  kind        textbook | paper | term_test | marking_scheme) Tj T*
(  examType    ol | al | grade5 | term) Tj T*
(  grade       the school grade \(1-13\)) Tj T*
(  year        exam year, for papers) Tj T*
(  medium      en | si | ta) Tj T*
(  rights      official_link | open_license | bundled) Tj T*
(  sourceUrl   the canonical publisher URL) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Only items whose rights allow it are ever offered for offline) Tj T*
(download. Everything else opens on the publisher's site.) Tj T*
