(A day counts towards the streak when the student either:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  * opens a textbook or past paper \(in-app or at its source\), or) Tj T*
(  * completes a quiz attempt.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Rules:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  * Consecutive calendar days build the streak.) Tj T*
(  * One missed day breaks it, unless a streak freeze is spent.) Tj T*
(  * One free freeze per calendar week.) Tj T*
(  * Longest streak and lifetime study days are never reset.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Everything is stored on the device. No account, no upload.) Tj T*
